				<int name="num-iterations">1</int> = self-explanatory (but it'll count everything twice so i.e max * iterations = actual max)
				<float name="num-boost">0.5</float> = this allegedly makes prefabs less repeatable, but its hard to measure
				<int name="min">1</int>
				<int name="max">1</int>	

				
				-->
